{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Character Silhouette.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Character Silhouette.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"character silhouette character silhouette","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Character Silhouette.md","fileName":"Character Silhouette.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Character Silhouette","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 15:28\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Game Presentation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Presentation","Game Character Design","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Character Silhouette.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Character Silhouette.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"character silhouette character silhouette","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Character Silhouette.md","fileName":"Character Silhouette.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Character Silhouette","heading":"Character Silhouette","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A character silhouette is the outer shape by which a game character can be recognized without interior detail. Different silhouettes let players distinguish behaviors even when color, texture, or facial features are hard to see.\n\nSilhouette matters most when several moving characters share a scene and rapid identification affects choice. Hair, limbs, weapons, shields, and proportions can all make a role legible while reinforcing [[Game Character Design|characterization]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Presentation","Game Character Design","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Character Silhouette.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Character Silhouette.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"character silhouette charac